### **The GAP for everyone**

Over a season, between trails, summits and rope pitches, we organise days of relaxation and conviviality.

Together with members and friends, we sit around a table to enjoy each other's company, tell stories of the mountains and support fundraisers for charitable projects.

We support the association **[Amici di Goundi](http://www.amicidigoundi.it/ "Amici di Goundi")**, which works in Chad. We recently raised funds for the victims of the earthquake in Nepal.

##### **Activities:**

Club lunch, chestnut party (Castagnata), ApeSKI, early-summer barbecue, pizza nights at the clubhouse.

